OL,3,GNEWSALido season extended after
OL,4,A'extraordinary summer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn outdoor pool's season has been
OL,7,Fextended by two weeks to give more
OL,8,Fchildren the chance to learn swimming
OL,9,Fand water safety skills.
OL,11,FPlymouth Active Leisure said Tinside
OL,12,FLido was due to close on Sunday but
OL,13,Fwould remain open until 27 September
OL,14,Fafter one of its "busiest and most
OL,15,Fsuccessful summers in recent memory".
OL,17,FIt said it hoped the pool, which
OL,18,Foverlooks Plymouth Sound in Devon,
OL,19,Fwould record more than 100,000 visits
OL,20,Fby the end of the season with extra
OL,21,Fsessions offered to schools.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
