OL,3,GNEWSALido season extended after
OL,4,A'extraordinary summer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRhys Jones from Plymouth Active Leisure
OL,7,Fsaid the lido was "more than a swimming
OL,8,Fpool" and extending the season could
OL,9,Fhelp create "a generation of children
OL,10,Fwho are more confident, active and
OL,11,Fconnected to the water".
